      "updated_at": "2026-01-10T09:52:59Z",
      "body": "They should be solved case by case.\n\nFor example, `PyNumber_Absolute()` in `math.integer.gcd` is only called after `PyNumber_Index()` which always return PyLongObject. This is why `PyNumber_Index()` is called for the first argument, but `_PyNumber_Index()` for other arguments.",
